#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello alderatzen dituen zure aurpegiaren argazkiak. Gutxienez bi "
"gorde, argiztapen ezberdinetan grabatuta."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Honetarako gordetako ereduak erakusten:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Aurpegi-eredu bakarra dago erregistratuta. Betaurrekoek, aurpegiko ilearen "
"aldaketak edo argiztapen desberdinak aldatu egiten dute kamerak zure "
"aurpegia nola ikusten duen, eta eredu bakarrak huts egin dezake (adibidez, "
"iluntzean lanparen argitan). Gehitu bigarren eredu bat betaurrekoekin edo "
"gabe, zure beste itxurarekin edo beste argi batekin, desblokeoa fidagarria "
"izan dadin."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Gehitu bigarren eredu bat"

