#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "Buruz"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Ongi etorri Ubuntu Hello-ra"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Konfigurazioa egin da!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Bukatu dugu! Ubuntu Hello aktibo dago orain ordenagailu honetan. Saiatu "
"normalean pasahitza idatzi beharko zenukeen edozer egiten autentifikatzeko, "
"adibidez sudo-rekin komando bat exekutatzea. Giltza-sorta desblokeatzeko "
"automatikoki gaitu baduzu, saioa hasteko giltza-jokoa edo KWallet ere "
"automatikoki desblokeatuko da saioa hasten denean.\n"
"\n"
"Ubuntu Hello Konfiguratzailea geroago ireki dezakezu ezarpen aurreratuagoak "
"aldatzeko edo eredu gehiago gehitzeko. Sakatu Amaitu behean leiho hau ixteko "
"eta Ubuntu Hello Konfiguratzailea irekitzeko."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Ziurtasun politika ezartzea"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Angelu, distantzia eta beste faktore batzuen aldaketak direla eta, aurpegien "
"bat ez da inoiz gordetako aurpegiaren ereduaren berdina. Orri honetan Ubuntu "
"Hello zein zorrotza izan behar den ezar dezakezu."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"Parekatzerik malguena eta azkarrena sartzen uzteko. Aukeratu hau "
"erosotasunak zorroztasunak baino gehiago axola badizu."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"Parekatze zorrotza, baina azkar hasten duzu saioa. Baliteke ez ezagutzea "
"angelu itxian edo urrunago zaudenean."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"Parekatzerik zorrotzena, saioa hastean urrats gehigarririk gabe. Gomendatua."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Saltatu oraingoz"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Aurpegi-eredu gehiago gehi ditzakezu geroago Ezarpenetatik edo honekin: sudo "
"ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Webcam konfiguratzen"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Infragorrien igorlea keinuka ari al da?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Begira ezazu hautatu duzun kamera: infragorri-kamera batek argi txiki bat "
"erakusten du, Ubuntu Hello probak egiten dituen bitartean. Honek zure "
"aurpegia iluntasunean ikusten duen ala ez adierazten digu."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Bai, keinu egiten du"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Ez, ezer ez da distiratzen"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello zure sistema automatikoki bilatuko du erabilgarri dauden "
"kamerak, beraz, ziurtatu zure webcam konektatuta dagoela. Detektatu ondoren "
"erabilgarri dauden webcamen zerrenda erakutsiko da. Aukeratu erabili nahi "
"duzuna eta egin klik Hurrengoa."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Webcamak probatzen, itxaron mesedez..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Datu-fitxategiak deskargatzea"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello aurrez prestatutako hiru datu-multzo behar ditu ezagutu ahal "
"izateko, eta orain deskargatuko dira. Deskargaren aurrerapena behean ikus "
"dezakezu."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Deskargatzen hasten..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Ongi etorri Ubuntu Hello-ra!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Bertsioa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Morroi honek konfigurazio-prozesuan zehar gidatuko zaitu eta automatikoki "
"konfiguratuko dizu Ubuntu Hello. Sakatu hurrengoa jarraitzeko."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello-k automatikoki desblokea dezake zure saioa hasteko giltza-"
"errantzia edo KWallet aurpegiko autentifikazioa erabiliz, saioa hasi ondoren "
"pasahitz-eskaerak saihestuz."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Gaitu giltza-joko automatikoa/KWallet desblokeatzea"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Berretsi pasahitza"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Itzuli"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Amaitu konfigurazioa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Hurrengoa"

